
===== PARTNER VERDICT (codex, 621s) =====

Implemented the backend-only chunk. No deploy, no nginx, no git commit.

Added:
- [server/index.js](Z:/328/CMPUT328-A2/codexworks/301/language/server/index.js:1)
- [server/app.js](Z:/328/CMPUT328-A2/codexworks/301/language/server/app.js:1)
- [server/auth.js](Z:/328/CMPUT328-A2/codexworks/301/language/server/auth.js:1)
- [server/keyStore.js](Z:/328/CMPUT328-A2/codexworks/301/language/server/keyStore.js:1)
- [server/config.js](Z:/328/CMPUT328-A2/codexworks/301/language/server/config.js:1)
- [Dockerfile](Z:/328/CMPUT328-A2/codexworks/301/language/Dockerfile:1)
- [docker-compose.yml](Z:/328/CMPUT328-A2/codexworks/301/language/docker-compose.yml:1)
- [.dockerignore](Z:/328/CMPUT328-A2/codexworks/301/language/.dockerignore:1)

Updated:
- `package.json` adds `server` script plus `express`, `better-sqlite3`, `cookie-parser`
- `package-lock.json` updated from install

API surface:
- `GET /api/health` -> `{ok:true}`
- `GET /api/me` -> hl-auth cookie verify, fail-closed
- `GET /api/keys` -> auth required, masked per-user keys
- `PUT /api/keys` -> auth required, stores `{provider, apiKey, baseUrl?, model?}`
- `DELETE /api/keys` and `DELETE /api/keys/:provider` -> auth required, clears provider key

Mirrors Alarmonizer by serving built `dist` under `/language`, using `hl_session`, `AUTH_INTERNAL_URL`, `AUTH_INTERNAL_KEY`, direct localhost internal verify, and a build-stage/runtime-stage container. Compose binds `127.0.0.1:4310` and persists SQLite under `/app/data`.

Verified:
- `npm run build` green
- `npm run lint:content` green, `0 leaks`
- `npm test` green, `33 passed`, `0 skipped`
- Local server smoke: `/language/` 200, `/api/health` ok, `/api/me` unauthenticated false, `/api/keys` 401 JSON

Note: `LOOPS.md` was already modified in the worktree; I left it alone.

